<!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><h2 id="italic" >
                        Italic
               </h2>
<p>Italic text is great for adding emphasis without being too overpowering. You might use italics to add emphasis to an opinion or a word that you want to stress gently. Just put underscores (_) around the word or phrase.</p>    <p>Example: _This is italic text._</p>    
                
    
    
    
                
    
                
                
                
        
                                                            
                                                                                                                        
                            
    
    

    
