<!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><h2 id="monospace" >
                        Monospace
               </h2>
<p>Monospace text is useful for technical discussions, sharing snippets of code, or differentiating certain words from the rest of your message. It gives a distinctive look different from the standard font. If you're troubleshooting tech issues with friends on WhatsApp, monospace can help clearly display commands or code snippets.</p>    <p>You can use monospace text by enclosing the text in three pairs of backticks (```).</p>    <p>Example: ```This is monospace text.```</p>    
                
    
    
    
                
    
                
                
                
        
                                                            
                                                                                                                        
                            
    
    

    
