<!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><h2 id="inline-code" >
                        Inline Code
               </h2>
<p>Inline code formatting helps in making code or specific instructions stand out clearly. It's particularly useful for tech support or when sharing commands that need to be entered exactly as written.</p>    <p>You can use inline code formatting by enclosing the text in backticks (`).</p>    <p>Example: `This is inline code`</p>    
                
    
    
    
                
    
                
                
                
        
                                                            
                                                                                                                        
                            
    
    

    
