<p>Inline code is quite like the monospace text. The major change in output is that the inline code comes out highlighted.</p>    <!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><h2 id="quote" >
                        Quote
               </h2>
<p>Quotes are very useful when referencing a part of what someone's said. Instead of just replying to the message, you can quote it and discuss the specific part you want. That would make responding to long texts much easier and more effective.</p>    <p>To create a quote, start the line with a greater-than symbol (&gt;) and a space.</p>    <p>Example: &gt; This is a quote.</p>    
                
    
    
    
                
    
                
                
                
        
                                                            
                                                                                                                        
                            
    
    

    
