<!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><h2 id="numbered-list" >
                        Numbered List
               </h2>
<p>Numbered Lists are similar to bulleted lists and are ideal for instructions, steps, or sequences. They make it easy for the reader to follow along with a process or a series of points. This is particularly handy for recipes, DIY projects, or any situation where order matters.</p>    

                
<p>To create one, use numbers followed by a period.</p>    <p>Example:</p>        <ol>
                    <li>
                                        First item
                        </li>
                    <li>
                                        Second item
                        </li>
                    <li>
                                        Third item
                        </li>
            </ol>

                
    
    
    
                
    
                
                
                
        
                                                            
                                                                                                                        
                            
    
    

    
