<!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><h2 id="combining-formatting" >
                        Combining Formatting
               </h2>
<p>Why stick to just one format when you can combine them? Mix bold, italic, strikethrough, and more for greater emphasis.</p>    <p>Example: This text is *bold*, _italic_, and ```monospace```.</p>    
                
    
    
    
                
    
                
                
                
        
                                                            
                                                                                                                        
                            
    
    

    
