<!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><h2 id="whatsapp-formatting-on-desktop-vs-mobile" >
                        WhatsApp Formatting on Desktop vs. Mobile
               </h2>
<p>You can use the same formatting features on both the <a href="https://www.howtogeek.com/676621/how-to-use-whatsapp-on-your-computer-and-web/" target="_blank">mobile app and WhatsApp web</a>. While the functionality is the same, the process is a little different on the web because of the interface. On the desktop, using keyboard shortcuts can make formatting even quicker.</p>    <p>With these simple formatting tricks, your WhatsApp messages can go from plain to engaging. Experiment with bold, italic, strikethrough, and more to make your conversations stand out.</p>    </div><div id="article-waypoint"></div></section>
    
            
                        
